Package: uniml
Type: Package
Title: Unified Predictive Modeling Toolkit
Version: 0.3.4
Authors@R:
    person("Steve", "Shi", email = "19943405117@163.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Steve Shi [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Steve Shi <19943405117@163.com>
Description: A unified toolkit for binary and multiclass classification
    modelling that chains preprocessing, feature selection, model training and
    tuning, evaluation, visualization, and SHAP interpretability behind one set
    of objects, while keeping a strict separation between the data that fits a
    model and the data that judges it. Models, tasks, resampling, and tuning are
    'mlr3' objects, multiple imputation is pooled with Rubin's rules, and
    results are exported in a layout that can be reopened outside R.
